NOTE ON THE CONTENT OF THIS DATASET

The data in this repository is entirely synthetic. It was produced by a
simulation written for HackUMBC 2026. It does not describe any real person,
and it is not UMBC's institutional data. Every student, graduate, employer,
course, salary, and outcome is fabricated.

No conclusion drawn from this data is a factual claim about actual UMBC
students, graduates, or employers.

